 stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Get the App</a>\n      <button class=\"iconbtn burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"mobile\" id=\"mobile\">\n  <a href=\"/\">Home</a><a about=\"undefined7616\">About</a><a about=\"undefined7645\">— History</a><a about=\"undefined7686\">— Vision & Mission</a><a about=\"undefined7743\">— Roadmap 2021–2031</a><a workers=\"undefined7794\">For Workers</a><a workers=\"undefined7831\">— Services</a><a workers=\"undefined7876\">— How to get help</a><a workers=\"undefined7930\">— Benefits</a><a saathi=\"undefined7975\">Become a Saathi</a><a saathi=\"undefined8015\">— Earnings calculator</a><a saathi=\"undefined8072\">— Saathi stories</a><a saathi=\"undefined8121\">— Apply now</a><a business=\"undefined8163\">Business</a><a business=\"undefined8198\">— Solutions</a><a business=\"undefined8246\">— Partners & incubators</a><a team=\"undefined8305\">Team</a><a team=\"undefined8332\">— Directors & advisors</a><a team=\"undefined8387\">— Our team</a><a contact=\"undefined8429\">Contact</a><a href=\"https://dash.onlinesaathi.org/login\">Login</a>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"phero\"><div class=\"wrap \"><div><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / Legal</div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M16 8h-6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8\"></path><path d=\"M12 17.5v-11\"></path></svg> Legal</span><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);margin-top:14px\">Refund Policy</h1><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">When refunds apply, how long they take and how to raise a dispute.</p></div></div></div>\n<section style=\"padding-top:50px\"><div class=\"wrap legal\"><nav aria-label=\"On this page\"><b style=\"padding:4px 10px\">On this page</b><a href=\"#s1\">1. Overview</a><a href=\"#s2\">2. General refund terms</a><a href=\"#s3\">3. Refunds for failed transactions</a><a href=\"#s4\">4. KYC verification failure</a><a href=\"#s5\">5. Important terms</a><a href=\"#s6\">6. Changes to this policy</a><a href=\"#s7\">7. Contact us</a></nav><article class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"upd\">Effective from 22 April 2024</p><h2 id=\"s1\">1. Overview</h2><p>Online Saathi is a third-party technology platform that connects users with service providers. We do not directly provide or control those services. This policy explains the limited cases where refunds may apply and our role in them.</p><h2 id=\"s2\">2. General refund terms</h2><h3>2.1 Completed services</h3><p>Once a service, subscription or offer has been purchased and processed with the provider, no refund is given. Please check all details before paying.</p><h3>2.2 Platform service fee</h3><p>Platform convenience charges are non-refundable, even if the user or the provider cancels the transaction.</p><h3>2.3 Third-party services</h3><p>Complaints about quality, delays or non-delivery are handled under the provider’s own refund or grievance process. We help with communication but do not control the outcome.</p><h2 id=\"s3\">3. Refunds for failed transactions</h2><h3>3.1 Automatic refunds</h3><p>If a payment is deducted but fails at our payment gateway, the amount is refunded automatically to the original payment method within 3 to 21 working days. Only the net amount is refunded, excluding gateway charges, bank fees and taxes.</p><h3>3.2 Disputed transactions</h3><p>If a transaction appears successful but you do not receive the service, email <a href=\"mailto:support@onlinesaathi.org\">support@onlinesaathi.org</a> within 48 hours. We will investigate with the payment gateway and/or provider. A refund may be facilitated, but the provider makes the final decision.</p><h2 id=\"s4\">4. KYC verification failure</h2><p>If KYC verification is not completed and the account is not activated, the payment is not refunded.</p><h2 id=\"s5\">5. Important terms</h2><ul><li><b>Role:</b> Online Saathi is a facilitator; third-party providers are responsible for delivering services.</li><li><b>Liability:</b> limited to refunding the transaction amount collected by Online Saathi, where applicable.</li><li><b>Indirect losses:</b> we are not responsible for indirect losses, damages or inconvenience.</li></ul><h2 id=\"s6\">6. Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may revise this policy. Updates will be posted on this page and/or sent by email or SMS.</p><h2 id=\"s7\">7. Contact us</h2><ul><li><b>Email:</b> support@onlinesaathi.org</li><li><b>Phone:</b> +91 90990 05251</li><li><b>Website:</b> www.onlinesaathi.org</li><li><b>Address:</b> The Antelia Business Hub, 405, Sardar Patel Ring Rd, Naroda, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 382330</li></ul><p>Using Online Saathi means you agree to this policy.</p></article></div></section>\n\n\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"fgrid\">\n    <div><a class=\"flogo\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/new-web/logo.webp\" alt=\"Online Saathi\"></a><p style=\"font-size:14.5px;max-width:300px\">Trusted last-mile a